<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman restarts IBM with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman restarts IBM with buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs resumed coverage of International Business Machines Corp,placing it on its recommended list, dealers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Talk of the brokerage's action lifted IBM shares in London as high as $174, up $2-1/8, they said.</p>
<p>The shares jumped $4-3/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
